  _textMeshPro: {fileID: 1111450261}
  stringArray:
  - A Mysterious man finishes writing a brilliant solution on his paper to never
    use pens again.
  - He falls asleep, unaware that ink monsters from the ink jar are creeping toward
    the paper!
  - Fairy Pip wants to save the coder's work, so she casts a spell.
  - The stationery comes alive under her magic, and...
  - ...They chant "THEY SHALL NOT PASS!""
  timeBetweenChars: 0.05
  timeBetweenWords: 0.2
